      "title": "POSE IMAGE OR VIDEO IN LOAD 3D NODE",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "After generating the 3D model, load the same model within the Load 3D node. In \"model\" > \"material\" on top left side of the view port, choose \"normal\" preview option.\n\n**To pose the model for image:**\n<br>- Pan, track or zoom in the viewport and image will automatically be the current view\n\n**To pose the model for video:**\n<br>- Click \"Start Recording\"\n<br>- Pan, track or zoom in the viewport\n<br>- Click \"Stop Recording\"\n<br>- Video will be saved to \"recording_video\" output"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "After generating the 3D model, load the same model within the Load 3D node. In \"model\" > \"material\" on top left side of the view port, choose \"normal\" preview option.\n\n**To pose the model for image:**\n<br>- Pan, track or zoom in the viewport and image will automatically be the current view\n\n**To pose the model for video:**\n<br>- Click \"Start Recording\"\n<br>- Pan, track or zoom in the viewport\n<br>- Click \"Stop Recording\"\n<br>- Video will be saved to \"recording_video\" output"
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
